TiddlyWiki was chosen as a simple way to apply javascripts.

Pressing enter doesn't work, yea. Even the output is not perfect at all.
Right now I'm just showing the idea.  

QuickDict is not written in HTML which I prefer cuz Google Chrome OS, Tizen, 
